OMPLISH THE MISSIONS AND PROGRAMS ASSIGNED BY THE U.S. DEPARTMENT OF ENERGY (DOE) AND MANAGE AND OPERATE THE LABORATORY.  THE LABORATORY IS ONE OF DOES OFFICE OF DEFENSE PROGRAM MULTI-PROGRAM LABORATORIES.  THE LABORATORY IS A FEDERALLY FUNDED RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT INSTITUTION (ESTABLISHED IN ACCORDANCE WITH THE FEDERAL ACQUISITION REGULATION (FAR) PART 35 AND OPERATED UNDER THIS MANAGEMENT AND OPERATING (M&O) CONTRACT, AS DEFINED IN FAR 17.6 AND DEAR 917.6.","generated_internal_id":"CONT_AWD_DEAC5207NA27344_8900_-NONE-_-NONE-","awarding_agency_id":930,"agency_slug":"department-of-energy"},{"internal_id":292027610,"Award ID":"89233218CNA000001","Recipient Name":"TRIAD NATIONAL SECURITY, LLC","Recipient UEI":"X7WUS5LRBQU3","Award Amount":35413596301.77,"Awarding Agency":"Department of Energy","Awarding Sub Agency":"Department of Energy","Start Date":"2018-06-08","Base Obligation Date":"2018-06-08","Last Modified Date":"2026-09-28 19:34:36","Description":"IGF::CL::IGF COMPETITION FOR MANAGEMENT AND OPERATION OF LOS ALAMOS NATIONAL LABORATORY","generated_internal_id":"CONT_AWD_89233218CNA000001_8900_-NONE-_-NONE-","awarding_agency_id":930,"agency_slug":"department-of-energy"},{"internal_id":295526820,"Award ID":"DENA0001942","Recipient Name":"CONSOLIDATED NUCLEAR SECURITY, LLC","Recipient UEI":"EWV8QKG1JUV7","Award Amount":34661763245.24,"Awarding Agency":"Department of Energy","Awarding Sub Agency":"Department of Energy","Start Date":"2013-01-08","Base Obligation Date":"2013-01-08","Last Modified Date":"2026-09-29 09:57:32","Description":"IGF::CL,CT::IGF MANAGEMENT AND OPERATING CONTRACT FOR Y-12 NATIONAL SECURITY COMPLEX, PANTEX PLANT, WITH AN OPTION FOR SAVANNAH RIVER TRITIUM OPERATIONS","generated_internal_id":"CONT_AWD_DENA0001942_8900_-NONE-_-NONE-","awarding_agency_id":930,"agency_slug":"department-of-energy"},{"internal_id":295476174,"Award ID":"DEAC0576RL01830","Recipient Name":"BATTELLE MEMORIAL INSTITUTE","Recipient UEI":"CWKJEXDG79A7","Award Amount":3108